    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "电机转速系统由 Y(s)/U(s) = 1/(s+3) 描述，其中 A=-3，B=1，C=1。设计要求包含积分控制、在 s=-5 处配置两个极点，以及在 s=-10 处配置一个状态估计器极点。扰动与控制作用在同一处进入。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The motor speed system is described by Y(s)/U(s) = 1/(s+3), with A=-3, B=1, C=1. The design requires integral control, two poles at s=-5, and an estimator pole at s=-10. Disturbance enters at the same place as control.",
